<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"> <head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>ScrapingAnt — Web Scraping API, Proxies, and AI Extraction in One Stack</title><meta name="description" content="ScrapingAnt is a Web Scraping API for builders: Headless Chrome, 3M+ rotating proxies, AI extraction, hosted MCP server for AI agents — one credit pool, one key. 10K free credits, no card."><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><link rel="canonical" href="https://scrapingant.com/"><meta name="robots" content="index,follow"><!-- Open Graph / Twitter --><meta property="og:type" content="website"><meta property="og:site_name" content="ScrapingAnt"><meta property="og:locale" content="en_US"><meta property="og:title" content="ScrapingAnt — Web Scraping API, Proxies, and AI Extraction in One Stack"><meta property="og:description" content="ScrapingAnt is a Web Scraping API for builders: Headless Chrome, 3M+ rotating proxies, AI extraction, hosted MCP server for AI agents — one credit pool, one key. 10K free credits, no card."><meta property="og:url" content="https://scrapingant.com/"><meta property="og:image" content="https://scrapingant.com/og/index.png"><meta property="og:image:alt" content="ScrapingAnt — Web data infrastructure for builders"><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"><meta name="twitter:site" content="@scrapingant"><meta name="twitter:title" content="ScrapingAnt — Web Scraping API, Proxies, and AI Extraction in One Stack"><meta name="twitter:description" content="ScrapingAnt is a Web Scraping API for builders: Headless Chrome, 3M+ rotating proxies, AI extraction, hosted MCP server for AI agents — one credit pool, one key. 10K free credits, no card."><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://scrapingant.com/og/index.png"><!-- JSON-LD: Organization + WebSite (site-wide), plus any per-page blocks. --><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Organization","name":"ScrapingAnt","url":"https://scrapingant.com","logo":"https://scrapingant.com/images/scrapingant.png","sameAs":["https://github.com/scrapingant","https://www.linkedin.com/company/scrapingant","https://twitter.com/scrapingant","https://www.facebook.com/scrapingant"],"contactPoint":{"@type":"ContactPoint","contactType":"customer support","url":"https://scrapingant.com/#contact","availableLanguage":["English"]}}</script><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"WebSite","name":"ScrapingAnt","url":"https://scrapingant.com"}</script><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Product","name":"ScrapingAnt Web Scraping API","description":"Web Scraping API with Headless Chrome rendering, 3M+ rotating residential and datacenter proxies, parallel concurrency, and AI-powered extraction — behind one API.","brand":{"@type":"Brand","name":"ScrapingAnt"},"url":"https://scrapingant.com/","image":"https://scrapingant.com/og/index.png","offers":{"@type":"Offer","priceCurrency":"USD","price":"0","availability":"https://schema.org/InStock","url":"https://app.scrapingant.com/signup"}}</script><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What is ScrapingAnt?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"<p>ScrapingAnt is a web data infrastructure platform — a single API that gives you headless Chrome rendering, 3M+ rotating proxies, parallel concurrency, and AI-powered extraction. We handle the messy parts (CAPTCHA avoidance, IP rotation, anti-bot fingerprinting) so your code stays clean.</p>"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is an API credit?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"<p>Each subscription includes a monthly pool of API credits. Most requests cost between 1 and 25 credits depending on the options you enable (proxy type, JavaScript rendering, etc.). The default request — Chrome rendering with standard proxies — costs 10 credits.</p>"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"I'm not a developer — can you build a scraper for me?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"<p>Yes. We regularly build custom scraping pipelines for clients who'd rather buy than build. We also partner with development agencies, so projects of any size are covered.</p>"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do I need a credit card to start the free trial?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"<p>No. The free plan includes 10,000 API credits every month with no credit card required. You only enter payment details if you upgrade.</p>"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How does the MCP server work?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"<p>One install command in Claude Code, Cursor, or Windsurf adds three tools your agent can call: get_web_page_html, get_web_page_markdown, and get_web_page_text. The agent uses your ScrapingAnt API credits, so the same plan covers both direct API calls and MCP usage.</p>"}}]}</script><!-- Favicon --><link rel="shortcut icon" href="/images/favicon.ico" type="image/x-icon"><link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/images/webclip.png"><!-- Fonts (IBM Plex Mono via Google Fonts) --><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap"><!-- Google Analytics --><script async src="https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-1ZZGTD3KKH"></script><script>
