              <p class="hp-feat-body">Standalone HTTP/HTTPS proxies for direct use — residential and datacenter pools across 100+ countries. Country, state, and city targeting in the proxy username; sticky sessions on demand; unlimited concurrency. Bandwidth-priced, separate from API credits.</p>
