              <h2 class="hp-h2">Plug it straight into your <span class="hp-mark">AI agent</span>.</h2>
              <p class="hp-feat-body">One MCP server, three tools (HTML, Markdown, text). Works in Claude Code, Cursor, Windsurf, and any other MCP-aware editor. Your agent reads the open web in 30 seconds.</p>
              <code class="hp-cmd">claude mcp add scrapingant --transport http https://api.scrapingant.com/mcp -H "x-api-key: &lt;KEY&gt;"</code>
