      <section class="hp-usecases">
        <div class="hp-container">
          <h2 class="hp-usecases-h">Six ways teams use <span class="hp-mark-dark">ScrapingAnt</span>.</h2>
          <p class="hp-usecases-sub">From real-estate price monitoring to AI agents reading the open web — one API does it all.</p>
          <div class="hp-usecases-grid">
            <a class="hp-uc-card" href="/price-scraping-api">
              <div class="hp-uc-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="M3 17l5-7 4 4 5-9" stroke="#1a1a1a" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div>
              <h3 class="hp-uc-h">Price monitoring</h3>
              <p class="hp-uc-body">Track competitor pricing across thousands of SKUs in real time, with proxies that don't get blocked.</p>
            </a>
            <a class="hp-uc-card" href="/google-search-api">
              <div class="hp-uc-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><circle cx="9" cy="9" r="6" stroke="#1a1a1a" stroke-width="2.2"/><path d="M14 14l4 4" stroke="#1a1a1a" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></div>
              <h3 class="hp-uc-h">SERP &amp; search results</h3>
              <p class="hp-uc-body">Scrape Google, Bing, and Yandex result pages with a single endpoint — JSON or raw HTML.</p>
            </a>
            <a class="hp-uc-card" href="/real-estate-scraping-api">
              <div class="hp-uc-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="M3 9l7-5 7 5v8a1 1 0 01-1 1h-4v-5H8v5H4a1 1 0 01-1-1V9z" stroke="#1a1a1a" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div>
              <h3 class="hp-uc-h">Real estate &amp; classifieds</h3>
              <p class="hp-uc-body">Pull listings, prices, and history from any portal — even when they hide behind JavaScript.</p>
            </a>
            <a class="hp-uc-card" href="/lead-generation-scraping-api">
              <div class="hp-uc-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><circle cx="10" cy="7" r="3.2" stroke="#1a1a1a" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M3 17c1-3.5 4-5 7-5s6 1.5 7 5" stroke="#1a1a1a" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></div>
              <h3 class="hp-uc-h">Lead generation</h3>
              <p class="hp-uc-body">Build B2B contact lists from directories, professional networks, and company sites at scale.</p>
            </a>
            <a class="hp-uc-card" href="/mcp-server-web-scraping">
              <div class="hp-uc-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="M5 3h10v14l-5-3-5 3V3z" stroke="#1a1a1a" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"/><circle cx="10" cy="9" r="2.2" fill="#1a1a1a"/></svg></div>
              <h3 class="hp-uc-h">AI agents on the web</h3>
              <p class="hp-uc-body">Give your agent live web access via MCP or direct API — clean Markdown, ready for the LLM.</p>
            </a>
            <a class="hp-uc-card" href="/review-scraping-api">
              <div class="hp-uc-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="M3 5h14v9H7l-4 4V5z" stroke="#1a1a1a" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"/><circle cx="7" cy="9.5" r="1" fill="#1a1a1a"/><circle cx="11" cy="9.5" r="1" fill="#1a1a1a"/></svg></div>
